  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Estimate Support to NAZ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this Multi-annual Programme Estimate (PE) is to support the National Assembly of Zambia (NAZ), towards implementation of selected capacity-building activities foreseen under the Support to the National Assembly of Zambia Programme II (NAZ II) project. The NAZ II project includes the PE and a service contract, and forms part of the Support to Effectiveness and Trans-parency in Management of Public Resources (EFFECT) programme, which is supported by the Eu-ropean Union (EU) under the 11th European Development Fund (11th EDF). This PE specifically aims to achieve the following results: _Improved capacity of the legislative scrutiny of the budget; _Improved quality of analytical policy briefs on the budget by the Parliamentary Budget Office (PBO); _Improved quality of Parliamentary Committees recommendations on the budgets; _Enhanced gender-responsive budget analysis. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
